  "limitations": [
    "Campus registration remains unset. Low floors are aligned to the preserved metric L4 core; upper floors are unchanged.",
    "The FIS images explicitly warn that viewer drawings may be inaccurate and updated CAD drawings are available. Later alterations are not verified.",
    "Ten inherited lower-floor room shapes are retained exactly under one uniform similarity per floor; 2154 additionally has door-swing protrusions clipped to its verified shared wall. Their approximate traces can understate printed areas by up to 18%; they are not individually stretched to force area equality.",
    "Existing low-floor outline fragments are retained under the same correction and are not full floor envelopes. Room source boundaries and shared core points establish placement independently of these fragments.",
    "Room 2333A is a separate data repair: its former shape occupied the location labeled 2333B on the 2024 drawing; the direct labeled south room replaces it while its identifier and schedule key are retained.",
    "Illustrative floor elevations are retained. Steps, seating, and door swing arcs are not modeled.",
    "The inherited 2154 door-swing protrusions are clipped to its directly visible shared wall, preventing an overlap with the newly traced 2152. Other inherited edges remain uniformly transformed."
  ]
